<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Welos Rental - Kode Verifikasi</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 20px auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border: 2px solid #047857;
        border-radius: 8px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 20px;
      }
      .header {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 20px;
        border-top: 4px solid #047857;
      }
      .header p {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #047857;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
      }
      .header-line {
        width: 90%;
        height: 3px;
        background-color: #047857;
        margin: 15px auto 0 auto;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 30px;
        color: #6b7280;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        text-align: left;
      }
      .content h2 {
        font-size: 20px;
        color: #047857;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
      .otp-box {
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border: 1px dashed #d1d5db;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 20px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .otp-label {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #6b7280;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        display: block;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .otp-code {
        font-size: 36px;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 5px;
        color: #111827;
      }
      .security-note {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #4b5563;
        margin-top: 20px;
        padding: 15px;
        background-color: #fef3c7;
        border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
      }
      .footer {
        background: #047857;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #ffffff;
        padding: 20px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <table class="container" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center">
      <tr>
        <td class="header">
          <p class="header-text">WELOS RENTAL</p>
          <div class="header-line"></div>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="content">
          <h2 class="content-title">Kode Verifikasi Akun Anda</h2>
          <p>Halo <strong><%= username %></strong>,</p>
          <p>Silakan masukkan kode OTP di bawah ini untuk menyelesaikan proses pendaftaran dan mengaktifkan akun Welos Anda.</p>
          <div class="otp-box">
            <span class="otp-label">KODE OTP ANDA</span>
            <div class="otp-code"><%= otpCode %></div>
            <div class="expiry-info">Kode ini berlaku selama 10 menit.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="security-note"><strong>Penting:</strong> Demi keamanan, jangan pernah membagikan kode OTP ini kepada siapa pun, termasuk staf Welos.</div>
          <p>Jika Anda tidak merasa mendaftar, silakan abaikan email ini.</p>
          <p>Terima kasih!</p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="footer">
          <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Welos Rental. All rights reserved.</p>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
